          "expression": "smug",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "His own advisers think he's finished. His enemies think he's a joke. By the end of the day, one of those two men will be gone, and the history of Japan will change direction.",
      "word_count": 34
    },
    {
