      "on_screen_text": "Oda Nobunaga",
      "narration": "To understand how unlikely this was, you need to meet Oda Nobunaga. Nobunaga was the heir to a small clan in Owari, a province in the middle of Japan. And as a teenager, he was a disaster.",
      "word_count": 37
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-05",
      "section": "The Great Fool of Owari",
      "start": 52,
      "duration": 15,
