          "expression": "smug",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "He wore his clothes half open. He tied his hair with bright cords. He walked through town eating chestnuts and persimmons, leaning on his friends' shoulders, and spent his days running around with village boys.",
      "word_count": 35
    },
