          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "At his own father's funeral, the story goes, he showed up dressed like that, walked to the altar, grabbed a handful of incense and threw it at the shrine. Then he walked out.",
      "word_count": 33
    },
    {
