        {
          "name": "Relative",
          "expression": "angry",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "Even his own family didn't trust him. In his first years as clan leader, he had to fight his own relatives just to keep his seat.",
      "word_count": 26
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-09",
      "section": "The Great Fool of Owari",
