        {
          "name": "Oda soldier",
          "expression": "determined",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "But the fool was paying attention. He trained his men with extra-long spears. He studied the new guns that had recently arrived in Japan with Portuguese traders. And he chose his men for their talent, not their family name.",
      "word_count": 39
    },
    {
