      "on_screen_text": "Imagawa Yoshimoto",
      "narration": "Now meet his neighbor, Imagawa Yoshimoto. Yoshimoto was everything Nobunaga was not. He was rich, respected and refined.",
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-11",
      "section": "The finest archer of the Eastern Sea Road",
      "start": 123,
      "duration": 18,
