          "expression": "closed",
          "pose": "bow"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": "\"Finest archer of the Eastern Sea Road\"",
      "narration": "He ruled three provinces along the Pacific coast and loved the elegant culture of the imperial court in Kyoto. People called him the finest archer of the Eastern Sea Road, a title that meant he was the strongest lord in the region.",
      "word_count": 42
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-12",
      "section": "The finest archer of the Eastern Sea Road",
