        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": "Why? Historians still argue.",
      "narration": "Historians still debate why. Maybe he wanted to reach Kyoto and take control of the government. Maybe he just wanted Owari. Either way, Nobunaga's land was right in his path.",
      "word_count": 30
    },
    {
