          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": "\"Fifty years of human life...\"",
      "narration": "Fifty years of human life, compared to the world below heaven, are like a dream, an illusion. In other words: life is short. Don't waste it.",
      "word_count": 26
    },
    {
