        {
          "name": "Rider",
          "expression": "determined",
          "pose": "walk"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "Then he called for his armor, ate his breakfast standing up and rode out of the castle. At first, only a handful of riders could keep up with him.",
