      "on_screen_text": "Around the side, or straight ahead?",
      "narration": "Historians still argue about exactly what happened next. The famous version says Nobunaga circled through the hills and came down on the camp from behind. Some scholars now think he simply marched straight at the enemy, hidden by the storm. Either way, the result was the same.",
