          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "His bodyguards fought hard, but the attackers broke through. Two of Nobunaga's samurai reached Yoshimoto himself. The strongest lord in the region fell in the mud of a small valley.",
