      "on_screen_text": "Tokugawa Ieyasu",
      "narration": "And remember that seventeen-year-old commander, Matsudaira Motoyasu? With the Imagawa clan in chaos, he broke free, went home and two years later became Nobunaga's ally. He later changed his name to Tokugawa Ieyasu.",
      "word_count": 33
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-42",
