          "expression": "smug",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": "Tokugawa shogunate, 1603",
      "narration": "Yes, that Tokugawa. About forty years after Okehazama, Ieyasu would win the struggle for Japan and found the Tokugawa shogunate, the government that gave Japan the long peace we saw in our last episode. The same peace that left the forty-seven ronin with no wars to fight.",
      "word_count": 47
    },
    {
