      ],
      "on_screen_text": "天下布武 Tenka fubu",
      "narration": "As for Nobunaga, he kept going. He took new provinces, marched into Kyoto and began using a personal seal with four words on it: Tenka fubu, roughly \"the whole realm under military rule.\" The fool now wanted all of Japan.",
      "word_count": 40
    },
    {
